Moader library and settings design mockup

The game cover images are from Nintendo‚Äôs UK catalog. The cartridge mark is original artwork for this mockup. The outlined wordmark adapts Bricolage Grotesque by the Bricolage Grotesque Project Authors (SIL Open Font License 1.1). Interface lettering uses DM Sans. The preview uses example game-mod and runtime data. The connection address is reserved for documentation.

Animal Crossing: New Horizons
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-games/Animal-Crossing-New-Horizons-1438623.html
https://www.nintendo.com/eu/media/images/11_square_images/games_18/nintendo_switch_5/SQ_NSwitch_AnimalCrossingNewHorizons_image500w.jpg

The Legend of Zelda: Tears of the Kingdom
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-games/The-Legend-of-Zelda-Tears-of-the-Kingdom-1576884.html
https://www.nintendo.com/eu/media/images/11_square_images/games_18/nintendo_switch_5/1x1_NSwitch_TloZTearsOfTheKingdom_BASE_image500w.jpg

Pok√©mon Legends: Z-A
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-games/Pokemon-Legends-Z-A-2533423.html
https://www.nintendo.com/eu/media/images/assets/nintendo_switch_games/pokemonlegendsza/1x1_NSwitch2_PokemonLegendsZA_KV_GB_en_image500w.jpg

Mario Kart World
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-2-games/Mario-Kart-World-2790000.html
https://www.nintendo.com/eu/media/images/assets/nintendo_switch_2_games/mariokartworld/1x1_NSwitch2_MarioKartWorld_image500w.jpg

Metroid Dread
https://www.nintendo.com/en-gb/Games/Nintendo-Switch-games/Metroid-Dread-1987653.html
https://www.nintendo.com/eu/media/images/11_square_images/games_18/nintendo_switch_5/SQ_NSwitch_MetroidDread_image500w.jpg

Settings coverage is based on Moader 0.1.3, commit 028cc8b2560645fb4544260be942ef62e0aa39fd.
https://github.com/H644b/Moader/blob/028cc8b2560645fb4544260be942ef62e0aa39fd/docs/USAGE.md
https://github.com/H644b/Moader/blob/028cc8b2560645fb4544260be942ef62e0aa39fd/web/index.html

endstream
